---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import srcImage1 from "../assets/turnip_1.png";
import srcImage2 from "../assets/turnip_2.png";
---

<div class="flex lg:flex-row flex-col items-center lg:items-start gap-20">
  <div class="flex flex-col lg:gap-15 max-lg:gap-5">
    <h1
      class="font-medium text-8xl lg:pl-20 lg:translate-y-10 max-lg:text-center text-left"
      style="color: var(--color-primary-dark)"
    >
      Meet Turnip
    </h1>
    <h2
      class="font-light text-4xl lg:pl-20 max-lg:text-3xl max-lg:text-center text-left"
      style="color: var(--color-primary)"
    >
      Find your next meal with just a picture
    </h2>
    <p
      class="font-light text-xl lg:pl-20 text-gray-600 w-4xl max-lg:text-lg max-lg:w-lg max-lg:text-center lg:-translate-y-8 text-left"
    >
      Meet Turnip, the AI-powered app that turns your pantry into your next
      meal. Snap one or more photos of your fridge or pantry and Turnip
      automatically identifies what's there, then hands you recipes you can cook
      right now. No manual entry, no wasted ingredients.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div
    class="flex flex-row lg:justify-end select-none items-center justify-center lg:ml-auto min-w-0 p-5"
  >
    <Image
      src={srcImage1}
      alt="Turnip Preview 1"
      class="w-88 -rotate-5 max-lg:w-60"
      draggable="false"
    />
    <svg
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
      fill="none"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      stroke-width="3"
      stroke="var(--color-primary)"
      class="w-8 h-8 -translate-y-10"
    >
      <path
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3"></path>
    </svg>

    <Image
      src={srcImage2}
      alt="Turnip Preview 2"
      class="w-96 rotate-5 lg:pr-20 max-lg:w-52"
      draggable="false"
    />
  </div>
</div>
